"hartchart.info.fourcornerColor.title" = "4 Corner Color";
"hartchart.info.standard.body" = "Set the metronome to 60 BPM to start.\n\nPlace this chart on a wall at distance. Cover one eye with a patch or your hand.\n\nStarting from the top row:\n\U2022 On the first beat \U2014 say the leftmost letter aloud\n\U2022 On the next beat \U2014 say the rightmost letter aloud\n\U2022 Then the second from the left, then the second from the right\n\U2022 Continue inward until you reach the center of the row\n\U2022 Move to the next row and repeat\n\nOne letter per beat. Say each letter out loud as your eyes land on it.\n\nDo this for 2 minutes with one eye patched, then switch to the other eye for another 2 minutes. You can also do it with both eyes open.";
"hartchart.info.fourcornerBW.body" = "Set the metronome to 60 BPM to start.\n\nPlace this chart on a wall at distance. Keep both eyes open.\n\nFollow an S-motion \U2014 not a circle \U2014 through the four corner charts:\n1. First letter, top-left chart (top-left corner of screen)\n2. First letter, top-right chart\n3. First letter, bottom-left chart\n4. First letter, bottom-right chart\n\nThen move to the second letter in each chart, following the same S-motion. Continue for 2 minutes.\n\nOne letter per beat. Say each letter aloud as your eyes land on it. Do not move your head \U2014 eyes only.";
"hartchart.info.fourcornerColor.body" = "Set the metronome to 60 BPM to start.\n\nPlace this chart on a wall at distance. Keep both eyes open.\n\nFollow the same S-motion as the B&W chart:\n1. Top-left chart \U2192 top-right chart \U2192 bottom-left chart \U2192 bottom-right chart\n2. Then move to the next letter in each chart and repeat\n\nAlternate what you say on each beat:\n\U2022 First target \U2014 say the letter or number aloud\n\U2022 Next target \U2014 say the color of it aloud\n\U2022 Continue alternating: letter, color, letter, color\U2026\n\nDo not move your head \U2014 eyes only.";

